  "config.salts_inventory_update.minimizable_windows.description": "在 Salt 窗口上显示最小化按钮。若关闭此选项，窗口将保持展开状态，且最小化控件会被隐藏。",
  "config.salts_inventory_update.open_inventory_when_containers_are_opened": "打开容器时自动打开物品栏",
  "config.salts_inventory_update.open_inventory_when_containers_are_opened.description": "当可见的容器窗口打开时，自动打开玩家物品栏窗口。",
  "config.salts_inventory_update.ghost_window_opacity": "幽灵窗口不透明度",
  "config.salts_inventory_update.ghost_window_opacity.description": "控制幽灵固定窗口预览在世界中渲染时的可见程度。",
